    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Eberron Campaign, Can't Have Another Dragonmark Feat)</em></p><p>The Mark of Shadow of Houses Phiarlan and Thuranni manifests on your skin. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Cunning Intuition.</strong> When you make a Dexterity (Stealth) or Charisma (Performance) check, you can roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to the check.</p><p><strong>Shape Shadows.</strong> You know the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMinorIllus]{Minor Illusion} cantrip. @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplInvisibili]{Invisibility} is also always prepared for you: you can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain that use when you finish a Long Rest; you can also cast it with any spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Your spellcasting ability for these spells is Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma (chosen when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Spells of the Mark.</strong> If you have the Spellcasting or Pact Magic feature, the spells on the Mark of Shadow Spells table are added to that feature's spell list.</p><h4>Mark of Shadow Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDisguiseSe]{Disguise Self}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSilentImag]{Silent Image}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDarkness00]{Darkness}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPasswithou]{Pass without Trace}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplClairvoyan]{Clairvoyance}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMajorImage]{Major Image}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterInv]{Greater Invisibility}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHallucinat]{Hallucinatory Terrain}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMislead000]{Mislead}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-IJBAfzUEy3HmJH8r\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect <em>Cunning Intuition</em> adds the 1d4 to the Stealth and Performance checks. The Spells of the Mark are not added to your class spell list automatically: prepare them from the compendium if your class can.</p></section>",
